commits.msg:
Portal estilo Game Pass, Pokémon, Resident Evil 4 e saves no PC

- portal: tela com as capas (início com destaque e fileiras por coleção,
  biblioteca com filtros), navegável por toque, teclado ou controle;
  selos de toque/controle e aviso quando o jogo precisa de controle;
  vira o app "AllGames"

Room check before every mod draw: skip drawing instead of overflowing the frame's display list

The frame's list is 0x5008 bytes inside one of two frame contexts (0x80301000 + n * 0xD150, from +0x8148);
running past it overwrote the other context's task header and the game exited with "Unknown task"

Battle stats: keep each scenario's numbers in the campaign file, for the campaign stats page

Each scenario adds a "game" line (time, scenario, result, rounds, level) and a "perf" line per character and row;
"label" and "row" lines describe the rows. Totals and the in-game Campaign view are unchange

feat(plugin): Learn I/O behind the learn feature: bundled packs, the Packs folder, the progress file, Learn jobs on the game worker

- learn.rs: the example pack bundled (packs/example.enthpack, rebuilt from content/lessons/example by a test;
  its SHA-256 equals enth-learn's fixture), FsPacks over

Critique fixes: your teams first, instant match page, spoken labels (md-v13)

- My games: star on teams you follow; older league-only results fold per day;
  sport filter lasts for the visit (no longer saved to settings)
- Match page: header drawn at once from known game data; winner underlined;
  t

fix: compra com cash do v584, cash no login (0x1032) e bot carrega a partida

- item_buy/item_gift_buy/item_gift_confirm: o config injetado é a raiz do YAML (product_version fica em global:);
  o recibo agora usa o do game server. Antes a compra com cash caía com KeyError e o cliente ficava sem resp

Étape 3 : backend Supabase (base, Edge Functions, anti-triche, admin)

- migration : players, game_sessions, level_results, scores, rate_limits ;
  RLS activée sans policy, droits retirés à anon/authenticated ;
  fonctions SQL atomiques (submit_level, player_rank, rl_hit, purge_all)
- Edge Function

chore: add game-sdk and games package skeletons

@kefche/game-sdk type-checks against the DOM-free base config, so browser
or Node globals in engine code fail typecheck (keeps it runnable in Workers,
Vitest and Deno). packages/games documents the per-game folder template;
the first games arrive in P

Prism Blocks: Godot 4 block puzzle game

Classic, 50-level adventure and daily challenge modes; fair tray dealer;
special blocks (ice, stone, bombs, gems); power-ups; coins and theme shop;
juice effects (fever mode, score orbs, shockwaves, crumble); minor/major
vibration settings; Kenney CC0 sounds;

Stage 1 / M1.2-1.3: campaign, saves, world map, hints, achievements, settings, Hall, audio

- Campaign table with chapters and three-tier hints; verified achievements re-derived by replaying runs (game-core)
- Local saves with tolerant parsing, safe storage fallback, mid-run resume, personal bests;
